# Copy these names into Apps Script → Project Settings → Script properties.
# Do not commit real values. This file is an example only.
#
# POE_API_KEY
#   Required. Create a key at https://poe.com/api/keys
#   Example value shape: paste the key, do not invent one in git.
#
# ALLOWED_USERS
#   Optional if ALLOWED_USER_HASHES is set.
#   Comma-separated usernames. The site lowercases them before the check.
#   Example: user_a,user_b,user_c
#
# ALLOWED_USER_HASHES
#   Optional if ALLOWED_USERS is set. Preferred when other people can open
#   Project Settings. SHA-256 hex of the trimmed, lowercased username.
#   In the bound spreadsheet use the menu 出題代理 → 計算使用者名稱雜湊.
#   Or locally: printf '%s' 'user_a' | shasum -a 256
#
# POE_MODEL
#   Optional. Default: Claude-Sonnet-4.6
#   Other public Poe model ids include GPT-5.4. The browser cannot choose.
#
# POE_MAX_REFERENCES
#   Optional. Default: 40. How many filtered questions are sent as style samples.
#
# POE_MAX_REFERENCE_CHARS
#   Optional. Default: 80000. Extra questions are dropped after this size.
#
# POE_MIN_INTERVAL_SECONDS
#   Optional. Default: 20. Per-username cooldown between generations. 0 disables.
#
# POE_DAILY_LIMIT
#   Optional. Default: 40 successful generations per username per script-timezone day.
#   Set 0 for no daily cap.
#
# POE_MAX_TOKENS
#   Optional. Leave empty to let the model decide. A low cap cuts answers short.
#
# POE_TEMPERATURE
#   Optional. Leave empty to use the model default.
#
# SPREADSHEET_ID
#   Optional when this project is bound to the question-log spreadsheet.
#   Set it if the script is standalone. The id is the long string in the sheet URL.
#
# LOG_SHEET_NAME
#   Optional. Default: UsageLog
#   Do not point this at an existing data tab.
